# User Guide

## Launching the Simulator
1. Open MATLAB
2. Navigate to the project folder
3. Open the main script or Simulink model
4. Launch the GUI

## Configuration Workflow
Users can configure:
- aircraft properties
- mission profile
- subsystem parameters
- hybridization strategy

## Running a Simulation
After configuration:
1. execute the simulation
2. inspect output plots
3. save results if needed

## Main Outputs
- thrust profile
- power demand
- fuel cell contribution
- battery contribution
- hydrogen flow
- hydrogen mass consumption
- battery SOC

## Notes
This repository may exclude some private stakeholder data, proprietary benchmarks, or restricted component files.
